ENGLISH

This repository is PUBLIC TO READ, and it is not free/open-source software.

The source is open on purpose: so that people who use Syden can verify its
promises (the store listing says "no ads and no subscription"), so that it can
serve as its author's portfolio, and so that anyone learning can study it.

YOU MAY: read, study, copy snippets in order to learn, quote it in technical
discussion, and report problems.

YOU MAY NOT, without written permission: use this code in another product,
publish copies or modified versions, distribute binaries built from it, or run
a service with it.

The name "Syden", the rabbit and the other artwork are not covered by that
permission to read: they are trademark and original artwork, and are not to be
used in other projects.

This is NOT an open-source licence in the OSI sense. It is the default position
of copyright law — all rights reserved — written out in full, because a public
repository with no licence at all leaves newcomers guessing.

Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
